#. module: bf_property_sign
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_sign.model_bf_property_assembly
msgid "Assemblée des copropriétaires"
msgstr "General meeting of the co-owners"

#. module: bf_property_sign
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_sign.model_bf_property_attestation
msgid "Attestation du syndicat"
msgstr "Certificate of the syndicate"

#. module: bf_property_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sign/models/bf_property_attestation.py:0
msgid ""
"Attestation signée électroniquement. ⚠️ Signer n'est pas remettre : l'art. "
"1068.1 C.c.Q. fait courir quinze jours de la demande du copropriétaire, et "
"c'est la remise qui les arrête. Portez la remise au dossier quand elle a "
"lieu."
msgstr ""
"Certificate signed electronically. ⚠️ Signing is not delivering: art. 1068.1"
" CCQ runs fifteen days from the co-owner's request, and it is delivery that "
"stops them. Record the delivery in the file when it takes place."

#. module: bf_property_sign
#: model:ir.model,name:bf_property_sign.model_bf_property_maintenance_log
msgid "Carnet d'entretien"
msgstr "Maintenance log"

#. module: bf_property_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sign/models/bf_property_maintenance_log.py:0
msgid ""
"Déclaration d'examen sur place signée par %(who)s (r. 8.01, art. 6). La "
"déclaration est datée du %(date)s et fait partie du carnet."
msgstr ""
"Declaration of on-site review signed by %(who)s (r. 8.01, s. 6). The "
"declaration is dated %(date)s and forms part of the log."

#. module: bf_property_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_sign.view_attestation_form_sign
msgid "Envoyer pour signature"
msgstr "Send for signature"

#. module: bf_property_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_sign.view_log_form_sign
msgid "Faire signer la déclaration d'examen"
msgstr "Have the declaration of review signed"

#. module: bf_property_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_sign.view_assembly_form_sign
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:bf_property_sign.view_council_meeting_form_sign
msgid "Faire signer le procès-verbal"
msgstr "Have the minutes signed"

#. module: bf_property_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sign/models/bf_property_minutes.py:0
msgid ""
"Procès-verbal signé électroniquement. ⚠️ L'art. 1086.1 C.c.Q. exige la "
"transmission aux copropriétaires dans les 30 jours, pas la signature : "
"l'échéance continue de se compter sur la transmission seule."
msgstr ""
"Minutes signed electronically. ⚠️ Art. 1086.1 CCQ requires sending to the "
"co-owners within 30 days, not signing: the deadline continues to be counted "
"on the sending alone."

#. module: bf_property_sign
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/bf_property_sign/models/bf_property_minutes.py:0
msgid ""
"Procès-verbal signé électroniquement. ⚠️ L'art. 1102.1 C.c.Q. exige la "
"transmission aux copropriétaires dans les 30 jours, pas la signature : "
"l'échéance continue de se compter sur la transmission seule."
msgstr ""
"Minutes signed electronically. ⚠️ Art. 1102.1 CCQ requires sending to the "
"co-owners within 30 days, not signing: the deadline continues to be counted "
"on the sending alone."

#. module: bf_property_sign
